-- [ ] 005 Port the delivery-details CSS (`delivery-summary`, `delivery-bar`, `delivery-legend`, `delivery-group`, `recipient`, `deliv-*` tints) from `design-system/` into `web/assets/css/app.css`, names 1:1 with the mirror.
